## Helper Casp that points graphics + ANIM_* slots at the Anime Girl (sketchgirl) pack.
## Clip names match the animation GLB basenames under assets/fighters/animegirl/models/.
## Import those GLBs into the model AnimationPlayer before playtesting (see README).

Name: Anime Girl
EditorName: Anime Girl (Custom Character)

#------------------------------------------------------------------
# Intended AnimationPlayer clip names (from sketchgirl Capoeira set):
#
#--- Stance / movement
# ginga_variation_1 ginga_variation_2 ginga_variation_3
# ginga_forward ginga_backward ginga_sideways_1 ginga_sideways_2
# ginga_sideways_to_au
#
#--- Attacks / kicks
# martelo_2 martelo_3 martelo_do_chau martelo_do_chau_sem_mao
# armada armada_to_esquiva bencao chapa_2 chapa_giratoria chapa_giratoria_2
# chapaeu_de_couro meia_lua_de_compasso meia_lua_de_compasso_back
# meia_lua_de_frente pontera queshada_1 queshada_2 rasteira_1 rasteira_2
#
#--- Defense / acrobatics
# esquiva_1 esquiva_2 esquiva_3 esquiva_4 esquiva_5
# au au_to_role macaco_side troca_1
# capoeira capoeira_2 capoeira_3
:Specs-Graphics:
def GRAPHICS_ModelPath str() = res://castagne/assets/fighters/animegirl/AnimeGirlModel.tscn
def GRAPHICS_UseModel bool() = 1
def GRAPHICS_UseSprites bool() = 0
